# EVERY WORLD BUFF FEATURE now lives in Readycheck_WorldTools: local
# drop detection, the guild timer network, map pins, the buff board and
# its sidebar page. Kept together so the whole lot can be switched off
# in the AddOns list as one thing.
#
# Settings stay here in ReadycheckDB (worldTools, worldBuffTimers,
# worldBuffs, worldBuffCache), so disabling that addon loses nothing.
# Mesh_Inbound, Core_Scan and CS_Gold reach into it behind nil-guards.

